    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Your features denote you as a Zerdian, with a short stature and long pointed ears to regulate your body temperature and for listening for threats from far away. You are Small. You also become Trained in Stealth and gain a burrow speed of 10 feet. When you reach 10th level, this speed increases and becomes 25 feet. When you Seek to listen for something, you gain a +1 circumstance bonus to the check.</span></p>"
